# Brought sprites — no generation refs

Files under `art/brought/` are user-supplied / third-party brought sprites.

## Forbidden

- Pass them (or paths under `art/brought/`) as `reference_image_paths` to `GenerateImage` or any similar image tool
- Use them as style, mood, composition, or “derive / restyle from these” references for new workshop previews, building art, icons, or other generated art
- Re-generate or remix them into new assets

## Allowed

- When the user explicitly asks to place that exact asset: **copy/install the file unchanged** into a mod Texture (or similar) path
- Read or list the folder only to locate a file the user named for as-is install

New brought drops go in `art/brought/` (see that folder’s README). Do not invent a parallel “brought” dump elsewhere.
